Feature · Existing File/Path · Existing SoT · Existing Function · Existing UI · Reusable Y/N · Gap · Proposed Extension · Duplicate Risk · New Collection Y/N · New Function Y/N · New Component Y/N

## CMS role split (reuse existing menus — no new top-level apps)

- **대시보드** — 오늘 현황, REVIEW_REQUIRED, quick links
- **운영센터** — 현장 입력 허브 (timeline, 경기, 심판, 사진, 구장, 의료, 검토)
- **AI 운영** — OCR/STT 추출·confidence·confirm/reject (**자동 Publish 금지**)
- **대회 운영 보고서** — event aggregation → 공식 보고서
- **리그 관리** — MatchOps SoT (**별도 score SoT 금지**)
- **팀 관리** — master/participant/exact link 상태
- **공지** — 협회 공지 (**현장 event 원본 복제 금지**)
- **축구장 대관** — venueReservations SoT
- **회계** — 대회 회계 SoT

## Field ingestion

카메라·업로드·음성·텍스트·quick action → **fieldLogRecords 단일 pipeline**.

Photo types: MATCH_RECORD, REFEREE_RECORD, OPERATIONS_REPORT, VENUE_STATUS, MEDICAL, MATCH_PHOTO, AWARD, OTHER_EVIDENCE.

원본 immutable · revision+audit · **soft delete only · hard delete 0**. 일반 사진 OCR 강제 금지.

## AI normalization

AI = 추출/분류/추천 (**확정자 아님**). confidence 낮음 / exact bind 실패 → REVIEW_REQUIRED. **자동 OFFICIAL·징계 확정 금지**.

## Exact binding (LOCKED)

자동 처리: `participant EXACT_LINKED + federationTeamId + platformTeamId`.

**금지:** fuzzy · partial string · display-only auto-link · name-similarity auto-link.

**SOURCE CONFLICT → HOLD** (예: catalog "중계" vs MatchOps "중평FC" → AUTO RECOVERY BLOCKED).

## Match result flow

Field event → normalized candidate → operator confirmation → MatchOps → OFFICIAL → syncFederationPublicMatchView → publicMatches → clubMatchProjections. **별도 club score SoT 금지.**

## Lineup flow

MASTER ROSTER → match lineup photo → AI extraction → master exact bind → eligibility → REVIEW or PASS → APPROVED MATCH LINEUP. **수기 임의 선수 자동 생성 금지.**

## Distribution visibility

- PUBLIC — 시작/진행/공식 결과/공개 구장·사진·시상
- TEAM_ONLY — 해당 팀 경기·결과·안내·사진·구장배정
- TEAM_MANAGER_ONLY — eligibility·출전정지·민감 선수 정보
- FED_ADMIN_ONLY — raw AI, review queue, 의료 상세, debug

## Club distribution (reuse 17C — COMPLETE)

- 경기 → `clubMatchProjections`
- 안내 → `clubTournamentNotices`
- 구장 → `venueReservations`
- Affiliated + EXACT_LINKED → own-team auto-load
- DISPLAY_ONLY / CANARY / TWO-DEVICE → club projection **금지**
- Wrong-team Delivery **0** · Manual Re-entry **0**

